{
    "title": "LandGlide: GPS Property Finder",
    "description": "Get the information you need on property across the United States with LandGlide\u00ae. LandGlide is a premier property data solution, giving you the most advanced and comprehensive parcel data and property line maps. LandGlide enables real estate agents, developers, land surveyors, appraisers and many other professionals to locate relevant property data.\r\n\r\nUsing GPS to pinpoint your location, access key parcel data no matter where you are. Simply hover over a property to instantly view details and easily search for properties by owner, address, or parcel number. LandGlide also allows you to save your favorites, add notes, and export all the property data you need. Access LandGlide on any device to make a property or home search easier than ever.\r\n\r\nLandGlide makes it easy to access over 158 million parcel records in over 3,200 counties covering more than 99% of the U.S. population. \r\n\r\nGet robust property and home search data and insights with LandGlide today.\r\n\r\nProperty Finder\r\n- View property data from over 156 million parcel records all over the United States\r\n- Find nearly any property, including land for sale and homes for sale by owner\r\n\r\n\r\nProperty Data for Real Estate Agents\r\n- Parcel data is available online and offline for easy access\r\n- View historical data and current information, including property owner, acreage, square footage, building description and more\r\n- Easily view and track property addresses, transfer dates, school districts and sale prices\r\n\r\nGet started with a free trial, with access to millions of parcel records all over the nation. Free for your first seven days. $9.99 / month or $99.99 / year thereafter.\r\n\r\nView our terms of service at https://reportallusa.com/solutions/landglide/terms_of_service.html",
    "descriptionHTML": "Get the information you need on property across the United States with LandGlide\u00ae. LandGlide is a premier property data solution, giving you the most advanced and comprehensive parcel data and property line maps. LandGlide enables real estate agents, developers, land surveyors, appraisers and many other professionals to locate relevant property data.<br><br>Using GPS to pinpoint your location, access key parcel data no matter where you are. Simply hover over a property to instantly view details and easily search for properties by owner, address, or parcel number. LandGlide also allows you to save your favorites, add notes, and export all the property data you need. Access LandGlide on any device to make a property or home search easier than ever.<br><br>LandGlide makes it easy to access over 158 million parcel records in over 3,200 counties covering more than 99% of the U.S. population. <br><br>Get robust property and home search data and insights with LandGlide today.<br><br>Property Finder<br>- View property data from over 156 million parcel records all over the United States<br>- Find nearly any property, including land for sale and homes for sale by owner<br><br><br>Property Data for Real Estate Agents<br>- Parcel data is available online and offline for easy access<br>- View historical data and current information, including property owner, acreage, square footage, building description and more<br>- Easily view and track property addresses, transfer dates, school districts and sale prices<br><br>Get started with a free trial, with access to millions of parcel records all over the nation. Free for your first seven days. $9.99 / month or $99.99 / year thereafter.<br><br>View our terms of service at https://reportallusa.com/solutions/landglide/terms_of_service.html",
